WEBVTT

00:20.670 --> 00:22.500
Then, I will introduce myself.

00:22.500 --> 00:27.300
I serve as the right hand of God
in the Holy Empire of Lubelius,

00:27.300 --> 00:31.840
as Chief Knight of the Imperial Guard
and Captain of the Crusaders.

00:31.840 --> 00:33.310
My name is Hinata Sakaguchi.

00:33.310 --> 00:36.310
Though our relationship will be brief,
I pray it will be meaningful.

00:36.660 --> 00:39.190
I have no interest
in the words of a monster.

00:41.750 --> 00:44.570
There's no doubt you're the monster
that killed Shizu-sensei.

00:44.570 --> 00:46.570
And now I'm going to avenge her.

00:46.570 --> 00:48.440
Put an end to all!

00:48.440 --> 00:50.410
Disintegration!

00:56.870 --> 00:58.170
Hinata, huh...

00:59.750 --> 01:00.460
Now...

01:01.250 --> 01:03.000
What will you do?

01:25.690 --> 01:26.980
Lady Hinata!

01:27.390 --> 01:28.410
Lady Hinata!

01:31.360 --> 01:32.740
You guys...

01:33.100 --> 01:34.200
What are you doing?

01:34.200 --> 01:36.130
We would ask you the same question.

01:36.130 --> 01:37.580
Attempting to get a head start?

01:37.580 --> 01:38.450
Are you stupid?

01:38.450 --> 01:41.250
There's no head start or anything.
I'm simply going there to talk.

01:41.250 --> 01:42.780
Oh, come on now.

01:42.780 --> 01:47.410
Given how clearly you are equipped
to fight, nobody would believe that.

01:48.090 --> 01:52.340
We have no interest
in standing atop your sacrifices.

01:52.340 --> 01:56.870
And Demon Lord Rimuru didn't say
that you should come alone, anyway.

01:56.870 --> 01:58.470
Do you understand the situation?

01:58.470 --> 02:00.220
We're dealing with a Demon Lord.

02:00.220 --> 02:03.850
I angered him, so this is my problem.

02:04.230 --> 02:06.240
Get back immediately.

02:06.860 --> 02:09.610
The other guys actually wanted to join,

02:09.910 --> 02:13.950
but it'd be a problem if all
the captains were to leave.

02:18.330 --> 02:20.580
So we agreed to have
vice-captain Renard stay.

02:20.580 --> 02:23.290
And we drew lots
and had Garde stay behind.

02:23.290 --> 02:26.250
Grade's face back then
was truly a sight to behold.

02:26.250 --> 02:27.040
You said it!

02:27.460 --> 02:29.210
I wish you could've seen that.

02:32.300 --> 02:33.930
Suit yourself.

03:00.490 --> 03:02.500
THAT TIME I GOT REINCARNATED AS A SLIME

04:15.110 --> 04:17.700
KINGDOM OF BLUMUND

04:18.280 --> 04:21.200
EPISODE 55: HOLY AND DEMONIC CLASH

04:21.570 --> 04:25.330
Blumund sure has advanced.

04:28.960 --> 04:33.670
I've only seen those kinds of
fancy outfits back in Engrassia.

04:34.670 --> 04:37.050
Is this made with monster materials?

04:37.050 --> 04:40.550
It's almost a waste to have this
high-quality stuff in such a small town.

04:40.550 --> 04:43.470
Do you think this is
the influence of Tempest?

04:43.470 --> 04:45.470
What else could it be?

04:45.470 --> 04:48.350
All this prosperity from doing
business with a Demon Lord?

04:48.350 --> 04:49.280
Let's go.

04:58.190 --> 05:00.950
Looks like the average citizen
is happy being here.

05:00.950 --> 05:01.820
Yeah.

05:02.320 --> 05:04.080
It's getting dark.

05:04.080 --> 05:05.620
I'm starving.

05:05.620 --> 05:07.080
Let's look for something to eat.

05:07.080 --> 05:08.830
Hm? What's that?

05:08.830 --> 05:10.590
The sign looks unfamiliar.

05:10.590 --> 05:12.080
It does seem like a restaurant.

05:12.080 --> 05:13.960
RAMEN

05:13.960 --> 05:14.960
What?!

05:14.960 --> 05:17.280
R-Ramen?!

05:17.800 --> 05:19.630
I wonder what it says.

05:19.630 --> 05:20.510
We're going in.

05:22.970 --> 05:24.600
Thank you for the wait!

05:24.600 --> 05:27.140
Here's your tonkotsu ramen!

05:28.220 --> 05:29.640
This is...

05:29.640 --> 05:33.570
...ramen,
without a shred of doubt.

05:34.400 --> 05:38.100
Um, could you tell us
what kind of food this is?

05:38.820 --> 05:40.950
With chopsticks, too.

05:46.010 --> 05:47.620
A thick tonkotsu pork broth!

05:47.620 --> 05:50.830
How did they get the dashi soup
from in this world?

05:54.000 --> 05:56.460
This texture, this flavorful taste...

05:56.460 --> 05:58.380
They blend well with the soup!

05:59.010 --> 06:01.170
We should try it as well.

06:01.170 --> 06:02.220
Y-Yeah.

06:02.220 --> 06:04.890
I'm not really sure
how to use this, though.

06:09.850 --> 06:10.810
Tasty!

06:10.810 --> 06:12.310
Wh-What is this?!

06:12.310 --> 06:14.600
The soup is shockingly good!

06:14.600 --> 06:16.560
I've never eaten
anything like this before!

06:18.110 --> 06:21.190
Rimuru's definitely involved in this.

06:21.190 --> 06:25.660
To think he managed to replicate
the taste this well...

06:25.660 --> 06:28.200
I thought I could never
taste this anymore.

06:28.200 --> 06:30.080
Thank you for waiting!

06:30.080 --> 06:31.650
Here's your gyoza!

06:32.580 --> 06:34.330
What a yet another strange dish!

06:37.290 --> 06:38.070
Ouch.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.510
Lady Hinata?

06:42.010 --> 06:43.720
Do you have... a sensitive tongue?

06:43.720 --> 06:45.090
What are you saying, Bacchus?

06:45.090 --> 06:48.430
The great captain of the Crusaders
can't possibly have such a weakness!

06:48.430 --> 06:51.530
Litus's right! How can the world's
strongest not handle hot food?

06:51.530 --> 06:52.930
Yeah, you're right!

06:59.320 --> 07:00.860
So she does...

07:00.860 --> 07:02.360
...have a sensitive tongue.

07:02.360 --> 07:04.030
I-I'll have one, too!

07:04.030 --> 07:05.150
- Yeah!
- Me too!

07:08.070 --> 07:09.780
This is so good!

07:09.780 --> 07:11.660
So much gravy!

07:11.660 --> 07:13.580
It tastes like a revolution in my mouth!

07:13.580 --> 07:16.540
Oh, it's the last one!
Don't mind if I do—

07:19.040 --> 07:22.050
This's my prey, Fritz.

07:22.050 --> 07:23.750
M-My bad...

07:23.750 --> 07:25.930
It was just so good
that I couldn't help myself...

07:25.930 --> 07:28.550
If you haven't had enough,
you could always just order more.

07:28.550 --> 07:30.050
More gyoza, please!

07:30.050 --> 07:32.910
I'm sorry,
but that was today's last supply.

07:33.810 --> 07:38.810
That's actually a new product directly
from the Demon Lord himself.

07:38.810 --> 07:41.480
So our stock is still limited.

07:41.480 --> 07:42.940
O-Oh, I see.

07:42.940 --> 07:44.190
- Directly from Demon Lord himself?!
- I see.

07:44.190 --> 07:45.440
- Wow!
- She must've been instructed

07:45.440 --> 07:46.990
- He's also versed in cooking?
- to advertise it like that.

07:46.990 --> 07:47.950
The last one...

07:48.570 --> 07:49.570
Thanks.

07:50.240 --> 07:51.830
That was very good.

07:51.830 --> 07:53.410
Thank you very much.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.740
Just a warning.

07:56.160 --> 07:58.430
If you drink all the soup, too,
you'll gain weight.

07:58.430 --> 08:00.880
Huh? But... You did...?

08:00.880 --> 08:02.170
I don't get fat.

08:05.130 --> 08:06.220
How unfair...

08:07.470 --> 08:08.720
GREAT FOREST OF JURA

08:08.720 --> 08:11.890
Great Forest of Jura is a treacherous
road to take for people...

08:11.890 --> 08:14.930
But this is the only road
connected to Tempest...

08:14.930 --> 08:16.480
...or at least, it was.

08:16.480 --> 08:19.020
It's such a smooth ride.
It almost bores me.

08:19.020 --> 08:21.690
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
What's going on with this road?!

08:21.690 --> 08:24.610
It's as neatly paved as
the streets of the Engrassia capital!

08:24.610 --> 08:26.690
No matter how you spin it,
this is crazy!

08:28.200 --> 08:30.360
I don't sense any presence of monsters.

08:30.360 --> 08:33.870
It seems they have Anti-Magic Barriers
set across the highway.

08:33.870 --> 08:34.990
I see.

08:34.990 --> 08:37.710
This made the journey vastly safer.

08:37.710 --> 08:42.630
This must be why so many merchants
from Blumund are coming in and out.

08:45.550 --> 08:46.760
We've been spotted.

08:46.760 --> 08:48.440
Wait, Arnaud.

08:48.440 --> 08:50.050
I don't think they want to fight us.

08:50.050 --> 08:53.180
Hello! We haven't seen you guys before.

08:53.180 --> 08:56.270
You don't appear to be merchants.
Are you adventurers, then?

08:56.270 --> 08:58.230
Yeah, something like that.

08:58.230 --> 08:59.690
Oh, very good.

08:59.690 --> 09:03.270
I'm sure you'll be fine,
but I must warn you just in case.

09:03.270 --> 09:05.690
No dumping garbage
or fighting on the highway.

09:06.230 --> 09:07.510
If you're camping overnight,

09:07.510 --> 09:10.530
use the drinking fountains
located every 10km.

09:10.530 --> 09:11.820
What is km?

09:11.820 --> 09:12.570
Dunno.

09:12.570 --> 09:13.950
Just shut up and listen.

09:14.330 --> 09:18.330
If you want more safety,
there are patrol stations every 20km.

09:18.330 --> 09:22.630
If you have the money, you can also stay
in inns that are located every 40km.

09:22.630 --> 09:27.300
There are also glowing stone tablets
every 10km, but please don't touch them.

09:27.610 --> 09:30.090
Those things keep the barriers running.

09:30.090 --> 09:33.430
If you break them,
you'll get severe penalties.

09:33.430 --> 09:34.850
So keep that in mind.

09:34.850 --> 09:36.720
All right. We got it.

09:36.720 --> 09:38.220
Thanks for letting us know.

09:38.220 --> 09:39.060
Oh, it's fine!

09:39.380 --> 09:42.610
If you run into any trouble,
just let any of us know.

09:45.820 --> 09:48.030
They really have
drinking fountains here...

09:48.030 --> 09:49.570
And for free, too.

09:50.440 --> 09:52.670
This place's like a camping site.

09:53.280 --> 09:57.760
All while we were busy protecting
people from monster threats.

09:58.370 --> 10:00.870
I'm way past shocked by now, but...

10:00.870 --> 10:02.440
...I'm irritated.

10:04.380 --> 10:06.880
Well, he's like on a whole other level.

10:07.230 --> 10:09.880
It's like he has room to just
do whatever he wants easily.

10:10.880 --> 10:12.040
True.

10:12.510 --> 10:16.890
There's no way he can focus on these
little things unless he has the room for it.

10:18.430 --> 10:20.350
Judging by this highway alone,

10:20.350 --> 10:24.810
I think Demon Lord Rimuru must be
an incredibly gifted leader.

10:24.810 --> 10:28.360
He seems to be more devoted
to his rule than a lot of the barons.

10:28.360 --> 10:32.490
Rather than a Demon Lord,
he's more like a good governor.

10:32.490 --> 10:35.890
Like Arnaud said, there's a lot
we could learn from him.

10:35.890 --> 10:38.530
I believe we should try to
implement them in Lubelius too.

10:39.010 --> 10:41.910
I'm glad we never declared him
a divine enemy.

10:41.910 --> 10:47.880
Now we'll just have to hope he's willing
to accept Lady Hinata's apology.

10:47.880 --> 10:51.050
I'll have to be
as heartfelt with it as I can.

10:51.590 --> 10:54.450
But if he still wants to duel with me,
I'll have to accept.

10:54.450 --> 10:57.550
One of these silver coins
is worth ten copper coins.

10:57.550 --> 11:01.390
If you don't have enough exchanges,
get more of it from the exchange counter.

11:01.390 --> 11:03.350
All right. Thank you very much!

11:03.350 --> 11:07.810
Rimuru truly wishes for monsters
and humans to live together in harmony.

11:07.810 --> 11:10.360
But, if so, then why...

11:11.440 --> 11:13.700
Why would he want to fight me now?

11:17.570 --> 11:23.250
It appears Hinata's team will arrive
at Tempest this evening, as predicted.

11:23.670 --> 11:25.210
Good job, Soei.

11:25.210 --> 11:26.870
This is nothing.

11:27.270 --> 11:31.420
More importantly, are you sure you
don't want us to poison her instead?

11:31.420 --> 11:32.380
Don't be stupid!

11:32.830 --> 11:34.590
Two weeks.

11:34.590 --> 11:37.890
She came normally, not using
any magic to get here quicker.

11:37.890 --> 11:39.550
What's the matter, Benimaru?

11:39.550 --> 11:43.390
Hinata's seemed a little too bold to me.

11:43.390 --> 11:45.890
Perhaps this is a diversion?

11:45.890 --> 11:50.400
You're saying she deliberately draws attention
while another force launches a surprise attack?

11:51.110 --> 11:53.400
Yeah, that's possible.

11:53.400 --> 11:55.740
This is Hinata we're dealing with.

11:55.740 --> 11:57.490
How is the other group doing?

11:57.490 --> 12:01.770
They're laying low along the old path.

12:01.770 --> 12:03.740
If we hadn't spotted them
when they departed,

12:03.740 --> 12:06.540
I'm not sure we would
have noticed them at all.

12:06.540 --> 12:09.460
So they're in full-on military mode, huh...

12:09.460 --> 12:10.790
This is bad.

12:10.790 --> 12:14.760
We'll be at a huge disadvantage
if they deploy their Holy Field.

12:14.760 --> 12:15.880
Right...

12:23.680 --> 12:26.640
The magicule density here
is lower than expected.

12:26.640 --> 12:27.660
Yeah.

12:29.440 --> 12:33.440
Is Veldora's resurrection
just a lie all along?

12:33.440 --> 12:35.830
Then, Lady Hinata is...

12:37.990 --> 12:39.490
Renard.

12:40.730 --> 12:41.950
What a surprise.

12:42.370 --> 12:43.970
Seven Days Clergy.

12:44.510 --> 12:47.790
There is something we want you,
and only you, to know.

12:47.790 --> 12:48.870
Anything, sir.

12:49.460 --> 12:50.920
Actually...

12:51.500 --> 12:55.130
Hinata was involved
with the Demon Lord Valentine.

12:56.670 --> 12:59.590
When we were about to kill
Demon Lord Valentine,

12:59.590 --> 13:03.010
he revealed that to us
as he begged for mercy.

13:03.010 --> 13:06.520
Lady Hinata and Demon Lord Valentine?

13:06.520 --> 13:09.440
But that's not the end of this story.

13:09.440 --> 13:11.070
As unbelievable as it is,

13:11.070 --> 13:14.520
she's now trying to make a connection
with Demon Lord Rimuru.

13:14.520 --> 13:19.490
B-But, sirs, Lady Hinata's faith
is more stalwart than anyone I know.

13:19.490 --> 13:21.160
She would never betray us or our God.

13:21.820 --> 13:25.280
We, too, have our suspicions about that.

13:25.280 --> 13:28.870
There is one way we could
settle these doubts for sure.

13:28.870 --> 13:31.250
Wh-What is it?

13:33.210 --> 13:36.550
If we tell you,
there will be no turning back.

13:37.710 --> 13:39.210
I accept the risk.

13:40.880 --> 13:42.470
Rimuru...

13:42.970 --> 13:44.970
Defeat Demon Lord Rimuru!

13:46.220 --> 13:48.720
Do that, and we will have our answer.

13:48.720 --> 13:51.730
If Hinata is connected to him,

13:51.730 --> 13:54.900
she will no doubt rush to stop you.

13:54.900 --> 13:58.070
B-But that Demon Lord has
the Evil Dragon Veldora on his side!

13:58.070 --> 13:59.440
Do not worry.

13:59.440 --> 14:01.700
Calm yourself and think.

14:01.700 --> 14:04.950
Has the Evil Dragon truly awoken?

14:04.950 --> 14:09.040
Don't you think all of that
sounds too absurd to be true?

14:09.040 --> 14:10.700
Come to think of it...

14:10.700 --> 14:15.130
Only the Holy Emperor and Lady Hinata
have claimed to know of his revival.

14:15.130 --> 14:18.250
So you are saying Veldora
has not been resurrected?

14:18.250 --> 14:20.340
That is highly probable.

14:20.340 --> 14:23.930
Not even Reyhiem personally
witnessed the dragon.

14:23.930 --> 14:28.810
It may even be the case that Hinata
is deceiving the Holy Emperor himself.

14:30.770 --> 14:34.940
And Hinata has already encountered
Demon Lord Rimuru once.

14:34.940 --> 14:39.730
We suspect that was the moment
when she fell under his spell.

14:39.730 --> 14:43.610
If she has been doing Demon Lord
Rimuru's bidding ever since...

14:44.240 --> 14:45.570
That's right!

14:45.570 --> 14:48.620
Lady Hinata would never
willingly betray us.

14:48.620 --> 14:52.080
I'm the only one who can save her!

14:54.210 --> 14:58.670
It was my admiration of her
that motivated me to become a Paladin.

14:59.140 --> 15:03.210
Allow me, Renard,
to prove her innocence!

15:04.190 --> 15:05.510
Very well.

15:05.510 --> 15:08.550
Your resolve is strong.

15:08.550 --> 15:09.930
Renard.

15:09.930 --> 15:10.560
Yes, sir.

15:11.010 --> 15:12.770
Do us proud.

15:15.060 --> 15:18.070
We will now siege the entire town!

15:18.690 --> 15:21.440
All troops, split up to
your appointed position!

15:31.450 --> 15:33.000
An ambush?!

15:35.960 --> 15:38.880
Did Lady Hinata sell us out?

15:39.230 --> 15:40.840
All men, engage!

15:40.840 --> 15:44.840
Great Rimuru, it appears
the Paladins are on the move.

15:45.740 --> 15:48.890
They have attempted to fan out
and cover all directions around town,

15:48.890 --> 15:51.100
but Shion has intercepted them.

15:51.100 --> 15:53.390
A battle is reportedly underway.

15:53.390 --> 15:54.220
What?!

15:54.770 --> 15:58.600
I see...
So Hinata chose to fight.

16:03.860 --> 16:05.940
Lady Hinata, can you hear me?

16:05.940 --> 16:09.320
Yes.
What happened, Nicolaus?

16:09.320 --> 16:11.280
I need you to listen to me carefully.

16:11.280 --> 16:15.540
The Three Battlesages are secretly
participating in Falmuth civil war.

16:15.540 --> 16:16.870
They what?

16:17.280 --> 16:19.460
Did the Holy Emperor
tell them to do that?

16:19.920 --> 16:21.540
The details are unknown,

16:21.540 --> 16:24.710
but it must mean a lot if they're
going against your order like this.

16:24.710 --> 16:26.170
Huh? What?

16:26.170 --> 16:28.180
Anyway, beware of the Seven Days Cle—

16:30.180 --> 16:31.470
Nicolaus?

16:32.800 --> 16:35.350
Is something the matter, Lady Hinata?

16:35.350 --> 16:37.350
My magic call got cut off.

16:37.350 --> 16:39.350
It seems someone is blocking it.

16:40.350 --> 16:42.740
What did he try to tell me at the end?

16:43.360 --> 16:45.860
I think he said the Seven Days Clergy...

16:49.610 --> 16:50.950
This presence...

16:51.370 --> 16:52.430
Is that Renard?!

16:53.580 --> 16:54.580
Let's go!

16:57.200 --> 17:00.290
In the meantime,
I interfered with her magic call.

17:00.290 --> 17:03.090
I wonder who Hinata was talking to.

17:03.090 --> 17:06.300
It would appear she immediately
headed to the battlefield.

17:07.280 --> 17:09.010
It's pointless to think about it now.

17:09.010 --> 17:10.340
Let's go with the plan.

17:10.850 --> 17:13.970
I'll work things out with Hinata,
once and for all.

17:14.360 --> 17:15.220
Roger that.

17:15.220 --> 17:16.640
We won't let anyone interfere.

17:16.640 --> 17:17.720
I'm counting on you!

17:17.720 --> 17:21.810
Thank you for giving us the opportunity
to repay our debt to you.

17:21.810 --> 17:23.010
I'm tired of waiting.

17:23.010 --> 17:24.480
Hold off the enemies for us, okay?

17:25.440 --> 17:27.440
Shion's all fired up,

17:27.440 --> 17:30.820
but Team Reborn would face
an uphill battle against the Crusaders.

17:33.120 --> 17:33.740
All right!

17:34.200 --> 17:34.990
Let's go!

17:34.990 --> 17:35.740
Yes, sir!

17:35.740 --> 17:36.990
Wish you luck.

17:49.720 --> 17:51.430
U-Unbelievable!

17:51.430 --> 17:54.010
Our attacks don't work on them!

17:54.010 --> 17:57.220
They aren't undead,
so what's the meaning of this?!

18:07.730 --> 18:09.630
Heh, that won't be enough to—

18:31.340 --> 18:33.300
Just so you know.

18:33.690 --> 18:38.980
This knife has a super strong
sleep medicine rubbed all over it.

18:58.320 --> 19:00.410
I only told them to hold
the enemies back,

19:00.410 --> 19:03.660
but they're already taking down
over half of the enemy's force.

19:04.210 --> 19:05.750
Talk about going above.

19:06.710 --> 19:08.540
Gobwa, Gobzo.

19:08.540 --> 19:11.250
You two join in the battle.

19:11.250 --> 19:16.590
Um, in our last strategy meeting,
aren't we supposed to be on standby?

19:16.590 --> 19:18.350
Are you stupid?!

19:18.350 --> 19:21.720
We have victory within reach!
Can't you see that?!

19:22.100 --> 19:25.890
Securing victory against a stronger foe
is how you climb to the next level!

19:28.520 --> 19:30.980
Yes, you're right.

19:30.980 --> 19:33.900
Allow Team Kurenai
to seize this opportunity!

19:33.900 --> 19:36.070
U-Um...

19:36.070 --> 19:38.370
Won't that be against the orde—

19:38.370 --> 19:40.700
...or not. Maybe not.

19:41.370 --> 19:44.120
Shut up and do as you're told.

19:44.120 --> 19:47.350
Or do you prefer to be my test subject
for my latest kitchen delights?

19:47.350 --> 19:49.710
I'll let you pick which one you like more.

19:49.710 --> 19:52.800
I-I'll go!

19:53.570 --> 19:55.130
You sure this is all right, Benimaru?

19:55.590 --> 19:59.550
Not really, but playing it by ear
can have its benefits.

19:59.550 --> 20:02.580
She must've given orders like that
because she's certain she can win.

20:02.580 --> 20:03.680
True.

20:03.680 --> 20:06.350
If they can take
the enemies down unharmed,

20:06.350 --> 20:08.270
then there's no need to hold back.

20:30.980 --> 20:33.750
Still, what a powerhouse they are.

20:33.750 --> 20:36.840
To think there's another force
of that caliber serving this nation.

20:36.840 --> 20:39.090
Yeah, they're trouble.

20:39.090 --> 20:40.890
I bet they'd give me a workout.

20:41.330 --> 20:42.720
Great Rimuru.

20:42.720 --> 20:45.850
If this continues,
we might win this battle.

20:45.850 --> 20:48.390
This wasn't the plan, though.

21:08.410 --> 21:09.750
This is...

21:10.210 --> 21:13.710
We Crusaders are losing?!

21:15.670 --> 21:19.490
More importantly,
what are Renard and Garde doing here?

21:20.130 --> 21:22.860
Now that the battle has started,

21:22.860 --> 21:25.680
I don't think we can end this
with just negotiation anymore.

21:26.470 --> 21:27.770
Rimuru!

21:28.260 --> 21:30.060
That's the Three Beastketeers!

21:30.730 --> 21:33.770
...and are those ogres? No, kijin?

21:33.770 --> 21:37.400
No, they're oni.

21:37.400 --> 21:38.770
I've heard of them.

21:38.770 --> 21:42.240
They're monsters whose supernatural powers
put them on the level of regional gods!

21:42.240 --> 21:45.780
They're actually part of
the evolution ladder up from ogres,

21:45.780 --> 21:48.250
but only a very few of them
ever reach that level.

21:48.670 --> 21:51.180
Consider each one to be
a Special A-ranked threat.

21:51.710 --> 21:54.210
This is the Demon Lord's territory,

21:54.210 --> 21:57.500
and we're uninvited guests,
so to say, huh?

21:58.000 --> 21:59.970
I have four men under me.

21:59.970 --> 22:01.420
This is not a coincidence.

22:01.420 --> 22:04.000
Rimuru must've arranged
the numbers that way.

22:04.890 --> 22:06.510
I'll take you on.

22:06.510 --> 22:08.930
You and me, on a one-on-one.

22:09.270 --> 22:10.480
That's right.

22:10.480 --> 22:13.750
You wanted a duel with me, didn't you?

22:14.350 --> 22:17.360
So you didn't want any distractions?

22:18.900 --> 22:21.150
Team Two, push the enemies to the forest!

22:21.820 --> 22:23.320
Use the geographical advantages!

22:25.680 --> 22:28.030
Great Rimuru!
Everything is going according to plan!

22:28.030 --> 22:29.830
This wasn't the plan at all!

22:29.830 --> 22:31.960
It is such an honor
to receive your praise!

22:31.960 --> 22:33.330
I wasn't praising you!

22:33.330 --> 22:36.430
Now, it is time for me to go!

22:36.430 --> 22:36.880
Huh?

22:43.260 --> 22:44.760
Good grief.

22:47.260 --> 22:49.310
You got here faster than I expected.

24:36.350 --> 24:39.240
Next time, "Barking up the Wrong Tree."
